00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:17.000
<c.HEAD>"            &lt;p&gt;Pick any 7-bit byte. The law marks &lt;code&gt;a&amp;nbsp;XOR&amp;nbsp;b&lt;/code&gt; for every lit pair, and in &lt;b&gt;at most two steps&lt;/b&gt; it settles on one of 16 constants: the empty set, 7 points, 7 lines, the full set. Checked over all 128; watch one.&lt;/p&gt;"</c>

