<c.HEAD>"            &lt;p&gt;Four literals as vertices — WORD · GOD · OF · of — and the six edges between them, by raw bytes, with no padding. Only equal-length pairs are comparable. The one literal edge is a single bit.&lt;/p&gt;"</c>

