00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.000
<c.HEAD>"            &lt;p&gt;A literal read two ways. &lt;b&gt;Direction&lt;/b&gt; reverses it; &lt;b&gt;encoding&lt;/b&gt; rot13s the letters. Each switch is its own inverse — flip twice and you are back. The frame never changes, only the reading.&lt;/p&gt;"</c>

